@startuml 03-registration-analysis
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor #33444C
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F8FBFB
skinparam classBorderColor #335D64
skinparam packageBorderColor #60757D
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam maxMessageSize 180
hide empty members
top to bottom direction
class HomeUI0 <<boundary>> {
 subRegisterMember
}
class RegistrationUI0 <<boundary>> {
 inFullName
inPhone
inEmail
inUsername
inPassword
inConfirmPassword
subRegister
outError
}
class RegistrationResultUI0 <<boundary>> {
 outCustomerId
outFullName
}
class Customer0 <<entity>> {
 register(info)
}
class Account0 <<entity>> {
 username
passwordHash
fullName
role
}
HomeUI0 --> RegistrationUI0
RegistrationUI0 --> Customer0 : register(info)
RegistrationUI0 --> RegistrationResultUI0 : thành công
Customer0 "0..1" -- "1" Account0
note bottom of Customer0
Phân tích: register đặt tại thực thể liên quan.
Thiết kế: tách validation vào service,
lưu giao dịch vào CustomerDAO0.
end note
@enduml
